stion/problem "If $tan⁡x=\\frac{1}{3},$ for some value of $x,$ find the value of $12tan⁡(x+5\\pi )-6.$" :question/worked-solution "The period of $y=tan⁡x$ is $\\pi .$ Therefore, for any integer $n,$ we have\n\n$$\ntan⁡x=tan⁡(x+n\\pi ).\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=5$ into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}tan⁡x=tan⁡(x+5\\cdot \\pi )=tan⁡(x+5\\pi ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $tan⁡x=\\frac{1}{3},$ we get that $tan⁡(x+5\\pi )=\\frac{1}{3}.$ Therefore\n\n$$\n12tan⁡(x+5\\pi )-6=12(\\frac{1}{3})-6=4-6=-2.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-103307/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "eed0c7c3-0bb5-56eb-a9ca-9ec4dc7b3efe"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-103307"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-103312/selection/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" :answer/id #uuid "62a56e7e-f263-5601-9c41-6d5e7130a087" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103312/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "e0a826f0-a3c2-575e-989c-e86c586003a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103312/selection/112e16faafb4b6f1a20ccd9d9fb47646730540205a6f817173ebfc47bd6b5334" :answer/id #uuid "a0940e30-9ec3-5128-8c82-e880d846d564" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12-3\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103312/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "5995d2fa-428e-55e4-a841-d5291f482148" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103312/selection/0eff1efe53001dbc29c30f31cf7adfd7c7e3684a0a2cd809e2a4f949b6b06634" :answer/id #uuid "fbb42df1-0b63-574a-ad4d-193e63df65ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12+\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-103312/selection" :answer-